<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 28, left: 40, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '2px solid #D6DCE5', paddingBottom: 16 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>数据处理流水线：从原始图像到 DataLoader</Text>
    <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 999, padding: '6px 18px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>01 任务与数据</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 116, left: 40, width: 1200, height: 250, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 172, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 10px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>图像 + mask</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D7EE', marginTop: 6, textAlign: 'center' }}>原图与 _mask.png 成对读取</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 172, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 10px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>预处理</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EFF8', marginTop: 6, textAlign: 'center' }}>统一缩放 256×256 归一化</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 172, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 10px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>数据增强</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EFF8', marginTop: 6, textAlign: 'center' }}>水平翻转 / 旋转 / 亮度扰动</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 172, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 10px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>分层划分</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D7EE', marginTop: 6, textAlign: 'center' }}>按类别 70% / 15% / 15%</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 172, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 10px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>DataLoader</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D7EE', marginTop: 6, textAlign: 'center' }}>batch = 8 随机打乱</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 392, left: 40, width: 1200, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: '20px 24px', height: 224 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>为什么统一 256×256？</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 12 }}>
        BUSI 原图尺寸不一（数百像素级），全连接与编码-解码结构要求固定输入。
        分辨率取 256 在保留病灶纹理与显存开销之间取得平衡，mask 同步最近邻插值以保持 0/1 标签。
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 14px', marginTop: 14, alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>配置项：config.img_size = 256</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: '20px 24px', height: 224 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>为什么必须分层划分？</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 12 }}>
        三类样本比例约 437 : 210 : 133，若随机打乱，测试集可能良恶性分布失衡。
        按 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>类别分层</span>抽样保证每个子集分布一致，指标才可比、可复现（seed = 42）。
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 14px', marginTop: 14, alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>训练 / 验证 / 测试 = 70 / 15 / 15</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 50, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB', background: '#F7F9FC' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>乳腺结节智能分割 · 教学课件</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>06 / 21</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
